   289→    description: |
   290→      Workflows are structured process definitions. They capture the
   291→      steps agents should follow for specific triggers. Unlike prose
   292→      documentation, workflows can be queried and validated.
   293→
   294→      Workflows are trackable - tasks can reference them via --meta-ref
   295→      to track work on improving the workflow itself.
