   444→          - "task complete" - Finishing a task
   445→          - "bug fix" - Fixing a defect
   446→
   447→          Triggers are documentation, not automation.
   448→          Agents decide when workflows apply based on context.
   449→        implements:
   450→          - '@workflow-definitions'
