   499→        slugs:
   500→          - convention-schema
   501→        title: Convention Schema
   502→        type: requirement
   503→        status:
   504→          maturity: draft
   505→          implementation: not_started
   506→        description: |
   507→          Convention definition structure:
   508→
   509→          ```yaml
   510→          - _ulid: 01KF...
   511→            domain: commits       # Area this convention covers
   512→            rules:
   513→              - Use conventional commit format
   514→              - Reference task in commit body when applicable
   515→              - Keep subject line under 72 characters
   516→            examples:
   517→              - good: "feat: add user login flow"
   518→                bad: "Added login"
   519→              - good: "fix(auth): handle expired tokens"
   520→                bad: "fixed bug"
   521→          ```
